license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "2026.10.05"
date-released: 2026-10-05
abstract: >-
  Computer-assisted research on the covering number C(16,5,3), recorded as
  61 <= C(16,5,3) <= 65. Includes a structural analysis of 61-block covers,
  a preliminary (not yet certified) proof that no 61-block cover exists,
  checked exclusions of structured 64-block branches, a prescribed-symmetry
  search, and independent checkers for every certificate.
keywords:
  - covering design
  - combinatorial design
  - C(16,5,3)
  - lower bound
  - SAT solving
  - DRAT proof
  - computer-assisted proof
